"\n            更新源返回 404：%@\n            最常见的原因是仓库为私有（Sparkle 拉 feed 时不带任何凭证，GitHub 对匿名请求\n            一律返回 404），或者还没有发布过任何正式 Release。两种情况 Sparkle 都拿不到 appcast。\n            " = "The update feed returned 404: %@\n\nThe usual causes are a private repository (Sparkle fetches the feed with no credentials, and GitHub answers anonymous requests with 404) or no public release yet. Either way Sparkle can’t read the appcast.";
