"\n        合计 %@。\n        这些是迁移应用时留的兜底副本，全部移入废纸篓（可恢复）。\n\n        若某个应用迁移后一直正常，它的备份确实可以清；但备份是出问题时唯一的退路，\n        不确定时建议只清「应用已卸载」的孤儿备份。\n        " = "%@ total.\n\nThese are the safety copies kept when apps were moved. All of them will go to the Trash, where you can restore them.\n\nIf an app has been fine since the move, its backup can go. A backup is also the only way back if something goes wrong. If you aren’t sure, remove only orphaned backups whose apps are already uninstalled.";
