"\n            这个应用的更新曾中途失败（更新进程写外置盘被系统权限拒绝，应用本体被移走了）。\n            已把更新缓存里的新版本放回原位，链接已接通。\n\n            提示：这类失败与\"迁移/纯搬迁\"无关，是更新器写外置盘缺权限；\n            若再次发生，可先回迁内置盘完成更新，再迁移出去。\n            " = "An update of this app failed halfway: the updater wasn’t allowed to write to the external drive, and the app itself was moved away. The newer build from the update cache is back in place, and the link works.\n\nThis isn’t caused by moving with or without a link. The updater didn’t have permission to write to the external drive. If it happens again, move the app back to the internal drive, update it, then move it out.";
